devices, timelines, logs and assumptions) are reconstructions written for homefault and are MIT
licensed like the rest of the repository.

If you reuse homefault, keep the quotes with their links or remove them. If you wrote one of the quoted
posts and want your words taken out, open an issue and the quote will be replaced with a link alone.

homefault does not ship copies of the posts or reviews themselves, only the short quotes above.

Product and company names (Alexa, Home Assistant, Hue, Zigbee2MQTT, Matter, Kasa, ecobee, Shelly, Tuya)
